            "username": "Kirstine B.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Acne & Dark Spots",
            "text": "<p>“I have sensitive skin and easily breaks out. Micro needling really helped with my dark spots and I think it also calmed down my break outs. I have been dealing with break outs for 2 years and couldn’t find any solution. Good thing I found this and it’s a work of art. ”</p>",
