            "username": "Tiffany G.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Glow",
            "text": "<p>“My skin feels absolutely amazing after 6 weeks of use. It is glowing and more clear than it has ever been. I wish I had discovered this earlier in life.”</p>",
