            "username": "Lourdes F.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "badge": "Wrinkles",
            "text": "<p>\"I am loving the micro infusion. I was skeptical because nothing ever works for my face, except Botox. But let me tell you, I am seeing a difference already. I've only done three treatments and the my face looks so much better... It is a little painful in certain areas but for the few seconds of pain, it's worth it! Definitely give it a try and see for yourself.\"</p>",
