            "badge": "Dark spots",
            "text": "<p>“I’ve done three treatments now and have noticed my dark spots, scars and overall pigmentation has significantly improved. The bags below my eyes have lessened and my face looks brighter. I will definitely recommend this to my friends!”</p>",
