        "heading": "Go beyond surface-level skincare",
        "wistia_url": "8ohyliirnv",
        "wistia_url_mobile": "a1pykz2tp0",
        "text": "<p>Traditional creams are applied to the skin’s surface, where the skin barrier can limit how effectively active ingredients are absorbed.</p><p>Qure uses ultra-fine, 24K gold-plated 0.5 mm microneedles to create tiny microchannels on the skin’s surface. As you stamp, concentrated serums are applied with precision, helping active ingredients absorb more effectively where they’re needed.</p>",
        "features_heading": "6 Target Areas - 1 Solution"
      }
    },
